<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech RPIX closes higher led again by SPT Telecom.</title>
<headline>Czech RPIX closes higher led again by SPT Telecom.</headline>
<text>
<p>1200 GMT - The Czech RPIX closes higher on Thursday led by SPT Telecom.</p>
<p>* .RPIX rises 1.7 points, 0.16 percent, to 1,059.2.</p>
<p>* Turnover, 16.3 million crowns.</p>
<p>* SPT up 45 crowns to 3,415.</p>
<p>* Komercni Banka drops 49 crowns to 1,925.</p>
<p>* CEZ rises three crowns to 918. On Thursday CEZ said it would not pay any dividend on 1996 profits. The news came right at the end of the continuous trading session.</p>
<p>-- Robin Shepherd, Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
